{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"okais-sack-garden","version":1,"title":"Okai’s Sack Garden","ageTiers":["7-8","9-10"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"Okai loved plants. But his family’s yard was tiny, and it was covered in concrete. ‘There is no place to plant,’ he sighed. ‘Where there is a will, there is a way,’ said Uncle Doku.","sentences":["Okai loved plants.","But his family’s yard was tiny, and it was covered in concrete.","‘There is no place to plant,’ he sighed.","‘Where there is a will, there is a way,’ said Uncle Doku."],"alt":"A boy stands in a small concrete yard looking up at his uncle.","image":{"hash":"sha256:0016d0d169f8eb90b255012be363cd3382f8677af3f71750b80929a405886aa3","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:c361f1c32ca666859bf7ae16ae1f429f50b85c8f2fd98399be91316782f34e0c","durationMs":19560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2324],[2324,9193],[9193,13508],[13508,19560]],"words":[[0,511],[511,1149],[1149,2324],[2324,2707],[2707,3090],[3090,3983],[3983,4494],[4494,4877],[4877,5592],[5592,5975],[5975,6231],[6231,6614],[6614,7507],[7507,7763],[7763,9193],[9193,9831],[9831,10086],[10086,10342],[10342,10980],[10980,11236],[11236,12078],[12078,12334],[12334,13508],[13508,14147],[14147,14785],[14785,15040],[15040,15168],[15168,15883],[15883,16521],[16521,16777],[16777,16904],[16904,17492],[17492,18002],[18002,18641],[18641,19560]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Uncle Doku found an old sack. ‘We can grow food in this,’ he said. He filled it with soil, mixed in some compost and put it in a sunny corner.","sentences":["Uncle Doku found an old sack.","‘We can grow food in this,’ he said.","He filled it with soil, mixed in some compost and put it in a sunny corner."],"alt":"A man and a boy fill an old sack with soil in a sunny corner of a yard.","image":{"hash":"sha256:f2de72d65d3b80924a7bd3d87b98390c13641db21f330afd2eb66dbd91fa3251","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:e8844dcac5727333ca9288beec23bf672a5c4505f059dc1ec90d38868ae194ea","durationMs":14560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3211],[3211,6863],[6863,14560]],"words":[[0,613],[613,1103],[1103,1716],[1716,1961],[1961,2329],[2329,3211],[3211,3456],[3456,3824],[3824,4314],[4314,4804],[4804,5049],[5049,5736],[5736,5981],[5981,6863],[6863,7108],[7108,7844],[7844,8089],[8089,8579],[8579,9265],[9265,9878],[9878,10123],[10123,10614],[10614,11472],[11472,11839],[11839,12207],[12207,12452],[12452,12697],[12697,12820],[12820,13432],[13432,14560]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"‘What is compost?’ asked Okai. ‘It is old peelings and leaves that have rotted,’ said Uncle Doku. ‘It gives food to the soil, so the plants grow strong.’","sentences":["‘What is compost?’ asked Okai.","‘It is old peelings and leaves that have rotted,’ said Uncle Doku.","‘It gives food to the soil, so the plants grow strong.’"],"alt":"A boy holds a handful of dark compost while his uncle points to a pile of peelings.","image":{"hash":"sha256:2266284164b0cac1e619027f0d0b1ce9a8418cfbdeaf799f3c52eea06d186833","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:7523d7abb413403b392ecc8119ab4aceaeb0ba2871d6a1dda3541721bd6a69f2","durationMs":13520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2954],[2954,8757],[8757,13520]],"words":[[0,416],[416,624],[624,1685],[1685,2205],[2205,2954],[2954,3162],[3162,3370],[3370,3682],[3682,4514],[4514,4826],[4826,5450],[5450,5866],[5866,6282],[6282,7072],[7072,7488],[7488,8008],[8008,8757],[8757,8965],[8965,9485],[9485,9901],[9901,10109],[10109,10421],[10421,11003],[11003,11211],[11211,11523],[11523,12147],[12147,12563],[12563,13520]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Okai made holes and planted tiny seeds. He pushed each seed into the soil with his finger. ‘Now we wait,’ said Uncle Doku. ‘And we water.’","sentences":["Okai made holes and planted tiny seeds.","He pushed each seed into the soil with his finger.","‘Now we wait,’ said Uncle Doku.","‘And we water.’"],"alt":"A boy pushes seeds into the soil of a sack with his finger.","image":{"hash":"sha256:8deeeb6f3c6b8131e0e4d82949f8f40a6f2f8bc198cf8eea2a5e02c618571d6d","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:cfa5eb7fbb6c85051160cba55c7a59a0f7d7b2fb5c65f735f2083876c463a565","durationMs":14200,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4222],[4222,9403],[9403,12617],[12617,14200]],"words":[[0,480],[480,959],[959,1559],[1559,1919],[1919,2758],[2758,3238],[3238,4222],[4222,4461],[4461,5181],[5181,5661],[5661,6141],[6141,6620],[6620,6980],[6980,7460],[7460,7940],[7940,8299],[8299,9403],[9403,9763],[9763,10002],[10002,10674],[10674,11154],[11154,11753],[11753,12617],[12617,12977],[12977,13217],[13217,14200]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"Every morning, Okai gave the sack a little water. Plants need sun, water and soil. He checked each day for green shoots. On day six, there were tiny green leaves.","sentences":["Every morning, Okai gave the sack a little water.","Plants need sun, water and soil.","He checked each day for green shoots.","On day six, there were tiny green leaves."],"alt":"A boy waters a sack with a can while tiny shoots show in the soil.","image":{"hash":"sha256:818ab950621a25c9afdd3b49b15e91f82e071386e4713975b446e0392ac50bb3","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:0f81d5d2fdde4a65494a71bd48bfd129387758ad876b6f8be24461d2abe78ec1","durationMs":17560,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,5356],[5356,9000],[9000,13060],[13060,17560]],"words":[[0,611],[611,1663],[1663,2152],[2152,2641],[2641,3008],[3008,3497],[3497,3620],[3620,4353],[4353,5356],[5356,6090],[6090,6579],[6579,7141],[7141,7753],[7753,8120],[8120,9000],[9000,9245],[9245,10101],[10101,10590],[10590,10957],[10957,11324],[11324,11935],[11935,13060],[13060,13305],[13305,13671],[13671,14234],[14234,14845],[14845,15334],[15334,15824],[15824,16435],[16435,17560]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"After some weeks, the plants were big. Okai picked some leaves. Mama cooked them in a stew. ‘Delicious!’ said Papa. Okai washed the leaves well before cooking, just as Uncle Doku had taught him.","sentences":["After some weeks, the plants were big.","Okai picked some leaves.","Mama cooked them in a stew.","‘Delicious!’ said Papa.","Okai washed the leaves well before cooking, just as Uncle Doku had taught him."],"alt":"A boy picks green leaves from a sack garden while his mother holds a bowl.","image":{"hash":"sha256:5a8cb6284661ada23d995c1e2084c954c5783752d2ea48c48c43243d332088ab","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:943899c3c76cb6ad5997c24f3f169d0f6cfb563eadb2ce1c74f15a7aebd414c1","durationMs":20520,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,4118],[4118,6864],[6864,9727],[9727,12497],[12497,20520]],"words":[[0,592],[592,1065],[1065,1846],[1846,2201],[2201,2911],[2911,3384],[3384,4118],[4118,4592],[4592,5302],[5302,5775],[5775,6864],[6864,7337],[7337,8047],[8047,8520],[8520,8757],[8757,8875],[8875,9727],[9727,11171],[11171,11645],[11645,12497],[12497,12970],[12970,13680],[13680,14035],[14035,14745],[14745,15218],[15218,15928],[15928,16946],[16946,17420],[17420,17656],[17656,18248],[18248,18721],[18721,19076],[19076,19786],[19786,20520]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"There were many leaves. Okai shared some with the neighbour. She gave him a few coins as a thank-you. Okai put them in a tin. ‘For more seeds,’ he said.","sentences":["There were many leaves.","Okai shared some with the neighbour.","She gave him a few coins as a thank-you.","Okai put them in a tin.","‘For more seeds,’ he said."],"alt":"A boy hands leaves to a neighbour and puts coins in a small tin.","image":{"hash":"sha256:710be9a09785ac72fb8f414412602105a3115aa74b1527977591f074d55a37c0","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:28f70e4a39424f5229e07801f618b312f9a87acb09e3876f39f8172905ceb151","durationMs":13680,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2308],[2308,5759],[5759,9210],[9210,11310],[11310,13680]],"words":[[0,520],[520,936],[936,1351],[1351,2308],[2308,2724],[2724,3347],[3347,3763],[3763,4179],[4179,4491],[4491,5759],[5759,6071],[6071,6487],[6487,6798],[6798,6902],[6902,7214],[7214,7734],[7734,7942],[7942,8046],[8046,9210],[9210,9626],[9626,9938],[9938,10354],[10354,10561],[10561,10665],[10665,11310],[11310,11622],[11622,12038],[12038,12724],[12724,12932],[12932,13680]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"Okai looked at his sack garden. It was small, but it was alive. ‘You do not need a big space to grow something good,’ he said. The end.","sentences":["Okai looked at his sack garden.","It was small, but it was alive.","‘You do not need a big space to grow something good,’ he said.","The end."],"alt":"A boy sits beside his sack garden with a tin of coins in the evening sun.","image":{"hash":"sha256:cf63bd6a83f46c6267daa81315224916359507e792d26568c1382fcd63e35c1b","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:d597b09124b0092c35e460b904a44e6001644e31e2aa868ff639ab6f9a3d67c3","durationMs":14240,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3462],[3462,6874],[6874,13111],[13111,14240]],"words":[[0,491],[491,1228],[1228,1473],[1473,1841],[1841,2332],[2332,3462],[3462,3707],[3707,4076],[4076,4886],[4886,5254],[5254,5500],[5500,5868],[5868,6874],[6874,7243],[7243,7488],[7488,7857],[7857,8348],[8348,8470],[8470,8839],[8839,9452],[9452,9698],[9698,10189],[10189,11294],[11294,11981],[11981,12227],[12227,13111],[13111,13479],[13479,14240]]}}}],"activities":[{"id":"sack-c1","type":"comprehension","afterPage":3,"question":"What is compost?","options":["Rotted peelings and leaves that feed the soil","A kind of sack","A type of seed"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"sack-c2","type":"comprehension","afterPage":5,"question":"What do plants need to grow?","options":["Sun, water and soil","Only noise","Only plastic"],"correctIndex":0},{"id":"sack-ph","type":"phonics","afterPage":5,"targetSound":"sh","prompt":"Which words have the sh sound, like shoots?","options":["shoots","sack","shared","soil"],"correctIndexes":[0,2]},{"id":"sack-s1","type":"sequencing","prompt":"Put the story in order.","items":["Uncle Doku filled a sack with soil.","Okai planted the seeds.","Okai picked the leaves.","Okai put coins in a tin for more seeds."]},{"id":"sack-sel","type":"sel","afterPage":8,"prompt":"Okai made a garden in a small space. How do you feel when you make something grow?","feelingOptions":["Proud","Happy","Patient","Curious"]}],"glossary":[{"word":"compost","definition":"Rotted peelings and leaves that feed the soil.","pages":[2,3]},{"word":"sack","definition":"A big bag made of strong cloth or plastic.","pages":[2]},{"word":"shoots","definition":"The first small green parts of a plant that grow up out of the soil.","pages":[5]},{"word":"neighbour","definition":"A person who lives near you.","pages":[7]}],"assets":{"sha256:0016d0d169f8eb90b255012be363cd3382f8677af3f71750b80929a405886aa3":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/okais-sack-garden/page1-1.webp","bytes":93610,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:c361f1c32ca666859bf7ae16ae1f429f50b85c8f2fd98399be91316782f34e0c":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/c361f1c32ca6.mp3","bytes":157100,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:f2de72d65d3b80924a7bd3d87b98390c13641db21f330afd2eb66dbd91fa3251":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/okais-sack-garden/page2-1.webp","bytes":105476,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:e8844dcac5727333ca9288beec23bf672a5c4505f059dc1ec90d38868ae194ea":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/e8844dcac572.mp3","bytes":117164,"type":"audio/mpeg"},"sha256:2266284164b0cac1e619027f0d0b1ce9a8418cfbdeaf799f3c52eea06d186833":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/candidates/okais-sack-garden/page3-1.webp","bytes":123876,"type":"image/webp"},"sha256:7523d7abb413403b392ecc8119ab4aceaeb0ba2871d6a1dda3541721bd6a69f2":{"path":"/story-spark-preview/audio/7523d7abb413.mp3","bytes":108908,"type":"audio/mp